## Migration Strategy

### Phase A: Test and Verify (Day 1)
1. Add the new files
2. Run the test to ensure everything works
3. Don't change server.js yet

### Phase B: Integrate Routes (Day 2)
1. Add the route imports to server.js
2. Test that new routes work alongside old ones
3. Verify frontend still works

### Phase C: Remove Old Code (Day 3)
1. Remove old route handlers from server.js one by one
2. Test after each removal
3. Clean up any unused functions

