## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues:

**"Module not found" errors**: Make sure you've created the directories and copied all files

**Path issues**: Ensure your `config/paths.js` includes:
```javascript
USERS: path.join(baseDir, 'users.json'),
PENDING_USERS: path.join(baseDir, 'pendingUsers.json'),
PENDING_DELETIONS: path.join(baseDir, 'pendingDeletions.json')
```

**Session issues**: The system uses your existing session middleware - no changes needed

**File permission errors**: Ensure your app can read/write to the JSON files

